LLM works
------------
User prompt(UserQuery)

1. Tokenization - text is converted to word(token)
2. Numerical representation: numerical array - vectors
3. Transformer processing: Attention 
4. Next-token prediction: the model calculates probabilities for possible next tokens
----//numbers
5. Text generation: A decoding selected token -> response(text/image/audio/video)


